重，支持用户微调以匹配特定任务，并可在 RTX PC、DGX Spark 及 Jetson 等设备上运行。","reportEdition":"2026-08-01","reportKind":"monthly"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsa302cc01xaro41omun2e1h","title":"OpenAI Astra 以约2000美元证明10项数学难题","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-08-01T07:39:02.000Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmsa302cc01xaro41omun2e1h","https://x.com/gdb/status/2083457463337287721"],"articles":[{"id":"cmsa302cc01xaro41omun2e1h","title":"OpenAI Astra 以约2000美元证明10项数学难题","originalTitle":"","summary":"OpenAI 用下一代模型 Astra 内部版解决了数学与理论计算机科学领域的10项重大进展，总成本约2000美元（按 Sol API 价格计算）。Astra 证明了非 sofic 群的存在，并推翻 Connes 刚性猜想，成果涵盖 von Neumann 代数、高维球堆积、电路复杂度等。OpenAI 已发布全部10项证明，附 Lean 证书与 CoT 逐步推导。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsa302cc01xaro41omun2e1h","originalUrl":"https://x.com/gdb/status/2083457463337287721","publishedAt":"2026-08-01T07:39:02.000Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-08-01T07:39:02.000Z","discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"source","sourceId":"aihot-1tmk4tw","originalSourceName":"X：Greg Brockman (@gdb)","family":"outlet-1bl7nyf","kind":"community","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"研究与科学突破","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsa302cc01xaro41omun2e1h","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-10T04:49:32.496Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1tmk4tw","name":"X：Greg Brockman (@gdb)","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-10T04:49:32.496Z"}],"sectionLabel":"研究与科学突破","reportSummary":"OpenAI 用下一代模型 Astra 内部版解决了数学与理论计算机科学领域的10项重大进展，总成本约2000美元（按 Sol API 价格计算）。Astra 证明了非 sofic 群的存在，并推翻 Connes 刚性猜想，成果涵盖 von Neumann 代数、高维球堆积、电路