bpv","title":"WeatherNext 预测气旋：提前五天预警五级飓风","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-08-25T15:37:15.000Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmt8uphwp3qmhro73czv8pbpv","https://x.com/GoogleAI/status/2092275116503707733"],"articles":[{"id":"cmt8uphwp3qmhro73czv8pbpv","title":"WeatherNext 预测气旋：提前五天预警五级飓风","originalTitle":"","summary":"Google AI 发布 WeatherNext 气旋预测模型，可同时预测风暴路径、强度和规模，比现有系统多提供一整天的预警时间。该模型在 2025 飓风季实战测试中，提前五天预测飓风 Melissa 在牙买加的五级登陆，系美国国家飓风中心首次实时使用 AI 模型。模型单场风暴可生成多达 1000 次模拟，代码与权重已开源。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmt8uphwp3qmhro73czv8pbpv","originalUrl":"https://x.com/GoogleAI/status/2092275116503707733","publishedAt":"2026-08-25T15:37:15.000Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-08-25T15:37:15.000Z","discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"source","sourceId":"aihot-1cw0duh","originalSourceName":"X：Google AI (@GoogleAI)","family":"google","kind":"community","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"研究与科学突破","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmt8uphwp3qmhro73czv8pbpv","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-10T04:49:32.496Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1cw0duh","name":"X：Google AI (@GoogleAI)","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-10T04:49:32.496Z"}],"sectionLabel":"研究与科学突破","reportSummary":"Google AI 发布 WeatherNext 气旋预测模型，可同时预测风暴路径、强度和规模，比现有系统多提供一整天的预警时间。该模型在 2025 飓风季实战测试中，提前五天预测飓风 Melissa 在牙买加的五级登陆，系美国国家飓风中心首次实时使用 AI 模型。模型单场风暴可生成多达 1000 次模拟，代码与权重已开源。","reportEdition":"2026-08-01","reportKind":"monthly"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsa9czys01chrojdrdvterw0","title":"德国法院裁定AI音乐生成器Suno侵犯版权，驳回合理使用抗辩","topic":"应用","publishedAt":"2026-08-01T10:40:50.000Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmsa9czys01chrojdrdvterw0","https://the-decoder.com/german-court-rules-ai-music-generator-suno-violated-copyrights-rejects-fair-use-defense"],"articles":[{"id":"cmsa9czys01chrojdrdvterw0","title":"德国法院裁定AI音乐生成器Suno侵犯版权，驳回合理使用抗辩","originalTitle":"","summary":"慕尼黑法院裁定，AI音乐生成器Suno在训练过程及输出结果中均侵犯版权，并驳回其合理使用抗辩。法院认定Suno 3.5和4版本模型可复现六首知名歌曲的原创元素，构成“记忆化”侵权，且责任归于Suno而非用户。该判决还认定美国版权法下的合理使用不适用于此案，目前尚未最终生效。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsa9czys01chrojdrdvterw0","originalUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/german-court-rules-ai-music-generator-suno-violated-copyrights-rejects-fair-use-defense","publishedAt":"2026-08-01T10:40:50.000Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-08-01T10:40:50.000Z","discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"source","sourceId":"aihot-1uslcxv","originalSourceName":"The Decoder：AI News（RSS）","family":"outlet-ezirzi","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"版权与法律","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsa9czys01chrojdrdvterw0","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-10T04:49:32.496Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1uslcxv","name":"The Decoder：AI News（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-10T04:49:32.496Z"}],"sectionLabel":"版权与法律","reportSummary":"慕尼黑法院裁定，AI音乐生成器Suno在训练过程及输出结果中均侵犯版权，并驳回其合理使用抗辩。法院认定Suno 3.5和4版本模型可复现六首知名歌曲的原创元素，构成“记忆化”侵权，且责任归于Suno而非用户。该判决还认定美国版权法下的合理使用不适用于此案，目前尚未最终生效。","reportEdition":"2026-08-01","reportKind":"monthly"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmtfkvjwn0by7rou8vil9ysf1","title":"索尼与华纳起诉Anthropic，指控其大规模盗用版权音乐训练Claude","topic":"应用","publishedAt":"2026-08-30T08:50:20.000Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmtfkvjwn0by7rou8vil9ysf1","https://the-decoder.com/sony-and-warner-sue-anthropic-over-one-of-the-largest-and-most-blatant-ongoing-thefts-of-intellectual-property-in-history"],"articles":[{"id":"cmtfkvjwn0by7rou8vil9ysf1","title":"索尼与华纳起诉Anthropic，指控其大规模盗用版权音乐训练Claude","originalTitle":"","summary":"索尼音乐、华纳音乐等唱片公司起诉Anthropic及其CEO Dario Amodei和联合创始人Benjamin Mann，指控其未经许可使用数万首受版权保护的音乐作品（主要是歌词）训练Claude模型。原告称Amodei明确指示并促成侵权行为，每件侵权作品索赔最高15万美元。此前Anthropic已于2025年9月就盗版书籍训练达成15亿美元和解。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmtfkvjwn0by7rou8vil9ysf1","originalUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/sony-and-warner-sue-anthropic-over-one-of-the-largest-and-most-blatant-ongoing-thefts-of-intellectual-property-in-history","publishedAt":"2026-08-30T08:50:20.000Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-08-30T08:50:20.000Z","discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"source","sourceId":"aihot-1uslcxv","originalSourceName":"The Decoder：AI News（RSS）","family":"outlet-ezirzi","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"版权与法律","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmtfkvjwn0by7rou8vil9ysf1","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-10T04:49:32.496Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1uslcxv","name":"The Decoder：AI News（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-10T04:49:32.496Z"}],"sectionLabel":"版权与法律","reportSummary":"索尼音乐、华纳音乐等唱片公司起诉Anthropic及其CEO Dario Amodei和联合创始人Benjamin Mann，指控其未经许可使用数万首受版权保护的音乐作品（主要是歌词）训练Claude模型。原告称Amodei明确指示并促成侵权行为，每件侵权作品索赔最高15万美元。此前Anthropic已于2025年9月就盗版书籍训练达成15亿美元和解。","reportEdition":"2026-08-01","reportKind":"monthly"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsg5h9ay06durolg6bwl0p8e","title":"Cloudflare OS：面向智能体、应用与工作的开放平台","topic":"应用","publishedAt":"2026-08-05T13:00:00.000Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmsg5h9ay06durolg6bwl0p8e","https://blog.cloudflare.com/cloudflare-os"],"articles":[{"id":"cmsg5h9ay06durolg6bwl0p8e","title":"Cloudflare OS：面向智能体、应用与工作的开放平台","originalTitle":"","summary":"Cloudflare 开源新版 Cloudflare OS，任何组织均可部署并连接内部系统。该平台为每位员工提供基于公司上下文与技能的智能体工作区，包含隔离运行时、安全治理框架及可共享修改的个人应用。此前内部版本已供数千名员工日常使用，新版针对协作中的信息暴露风险重建了安全基础。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsg5h9ay06durolg6bwl0p8e","originalUrl":"https://blog.cloudflare.com/cloudflare-os","publishedAt":"2026-08-05T13:00:00.000Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-08-05T13:00:00.000Z","discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"source","sourceId":"aihot-1cb1g1c","originalSourceName":"Cloudflare Blog","family":"outlet-1vjpq3u","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"智能体与开发工具","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsg5h9ay06durolg6bwl0p8e","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-10T04:49:32.496Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1cb1g1c","name":"Cloudflare Blog","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-10T04:49:32.496Z"}],"sectionLabel":"智能体与开发工具","reportSummary":"Cloudflare 开源新版 Cloudflare OS，任何组织均可部署并连接内部系统。该平台为每位员工提供基于公司上下文与技能的智能体工作区，包含隔离运行时、安全治理框架及可共享修改的个人应用。此前内部版本已供数千名员工日常使用，新版针对协作中的信息暴露风险重建了安全基础。","reportEdition":"2026-08-01","reportKind":"monthly"},{"id":"h